    <h1># CV Drawer</h1>
    <p class="muted">Mac app · macOS 13 Ventura or later · Apple silicon &amp; Intel</p>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <p>A free Mac app for creating CVs and exporting them to PDF, or to DOCX
for editing in Word, Pages, LibreOffice or Google Docs. Your CVs,
the clause library and your settings are saved on your Mac;
nothing is sent anywhere.</p>
  </div>

